    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:32px;">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
    <p>GoOrganicAfrica is an agricultural education and digital product platform operated by Amoo Oluwatoyin Owolabi, based in Nigeria. This website provides a free Farm Profit Calculator, organic farming guides and blog content for farmers across Africa.</p>

    <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>The Farm Profit Calculator stores your country preference locally in your browser (localStorage) so the site remembers your selection on future visits. This data is stored only on your own device and is never transmitted to our servers.</p>
    <p>If you contact us via our Contact page, WhatsApp or email, we receive your name and contact details solely for the purpose of responding to your inquiry.</p>

    <h2>3. Google AdSense</h2>
    <p>This website may display advertisements served by Google AdSense. Google uses cookies to serve ads based on users' prior visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Ads Settings</a>.</p>

    <h2>4. External Links</h2>
    <p>This site contains links to Selar (for ebook purchases) and other external sites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of third-party websites. Purchases made through Selar are governed by Selar's own terms and privacy policy.</p>

    <h2>5. Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use only functional cookies necessary for the site to work correctly. We do not use tracking cookies beyond any automatically placed by Google AdSense.</p>

    <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>You may clear your browser's localStorage at any time to remove any data stored locally by this site. To request deletion of any information you have provided to us directly, contact us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>

    <h2>7. Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>All calculations provided by the Farm Profit Calculator are estimates only and do not constitute financial, investment or agricultural advice. Actual farm performance depends on many variables including yield, input prices, weather, pests, diseases, labour, transportation and market conditions. Always verify local prices and costs before making investment decisions.</p>

    <h2>8. Contact</h2>
    <p>For any privacy-related questions, contact us at <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> or via <a href="{{ site.whatsapp }}">WhatsApp</a>.</p>
